WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.169
Hilbert Smith, in every dimension.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.552
Known up to dimension three. Everything reduces

3
00:00:05.552 --> 00:00:07.911
to the p-adic integers acting faithfully.

4
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:12.351
Such an action would split one quantity into too many equal parts.

5
00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:16.457
Claimed: every such group is a Lie group.

6
00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:18.544
Not in Lean.
